		(property "Note" "The band's nPM1304 stops at 100 mA; this one charges at 32 to 800 mA and has the same 32 pins. Set about 225 mA, half the cell's capacity per hour. BUCK2 unused as in Nordic's reference configuration 2 (nPM1304 layout files; the same in the nPM1300's): VSET2 grounded, SW2 open, VOUT2 to VSYS. LED0-2, GPIO2-4 left open: not confirmed. CC1 and CC2 grounded: the input limit starts at 100 mA and firmware must raise it each time the charger is connected"
			(at 0 0 0)
			(layer "F.SilkS")
			(hide yes)
