		(property "Note" "The recording switch. It is in the microphones' supply itself: in the off position the microphones have no power and their rail is held at ground, whatever the firmware does. Terminal 2 is the common. Rated down to 50 uA at 3 V; here it carries about 1.3 mA at 1.8 V"
